  "strengths": [
    "Hive Metastore is the de facto catalog for Spark, Trino and Impala",
    "Handles very large batch SQL jobs over HDFS and object storage",
    "ACID ORC tables and Iceberg tables with time travel and compaction",
    "Materialized views with automatic query rewrite"
  ],
  "weaknesses": [
    "High query latency compared with modern MPP engines",
